            "text_9gtgpH": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<p>As an online retailer, we understand that occasionally an item purchased from us will not fit exactly as you wish and exchange is wanted. <br/>Therefore, we are pleased to announce that we will take care of your shipping costs until you are outfitted with the correct size of each item.<br/></p><p><br/></p><p>Three easy steps:</p><p>1. Make sure the items have not been used in the field, original tags still attached and the intial purchase was from Skre Gear USA</p><p>2. Follow the prompts on the next screen. (<a href=\"https://skregear.com/apps/redo/returns-portal#/login\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Click here to get started</span></a>)</p><p>3. Allow 7-14 days from when you drop off the package</p><p>If you need the return faster please call us direct at 435-295-4197. (Depending on how fast you need the return, you may be responsible for additional shipping fees.)</p>",
